# Settings ▸ Tabs ▸ "Player in the space's colour" (Ideas #366, whyady): the now-playing cards take the
# sidebar's own colour under a selected tab's white instead of Arc's near-white or black. Off is Arc's, and
# switching it recolours the cards at once on a dark space and a light one, and back.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
